@startuml

salt
{
  <b>CHECK FIT: USD OIS CURVE (CANDIDATE)</b> | [ Back to curves and surfaces ]
  --
  {
    Candidate | ^USD.RATES.OIS.3M^ | Derivation | IR_CURVE_BOOTSTRAP
    As of | now (no past read) | Config | ir_curve_bootstrap_config v3
  }
  [ Read candidate ] | [ Recompute candidate ]
  --
  {#
    Quotes over candidate | Pillar | Raw quote | Candidate | Difference
    . | 3M | 4.120% | 4.120% | (joined on screen)
    . | 2Y | 3.960% | 3.958% | (joined on screen)
    . | 5Y | 3.880% | 3.883% | (joined on screen)
  }
  --
  {#
    Pillar residuals | Pillar | Residual | Relative | Source
    . | 3M | - | - | no diagnostics operation
  }
  --
  {#
    Forward-rate smoothness | Segment | Forward | Step | Finding
    . | 3M-6M | 4.11% | - | not served

  }
  [ Run health check ]
  --
  {#
    Calendar and roll | Input | Value
    . | Tenor convention | RATES_SPOT_FORWARD
    . | Day count | A365
    . | Interpolation | LOG_LINEAR_DISCOUNT
    . | Split tenor | 1Y
  }
  --
  Candidate only | not published — this screen reads and diagnoses only
  --
  [ Arrange approval ] | [ Leave candidate ]
}

@enduml
